<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    05.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.906   PAY DATE   L10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.506    SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED THREE AND FIVE YEAR W/I</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURE, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
